# USERS type

### 202 - SUCCESS
POST http://localhost:8082/api/data-importer/import
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Roles: ADMIN

{ "type": "USERS" }

### 400 - Unknown type
POST http://localhost:8082/api/data-importer/import
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Roles: ADMIN

{ "type": "WRONG" }

### 400 - blank type
POST http://localhost:8082/api/data-importer/import
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Roles: ADMIN

{ "type": "" }

### 400 - body not exist
POST http://localhost:8082/api/data-importer/import
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Roles: ADMIN

### 403 - forbidden role
POST http://localhost:8082/api/data-importer/import
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Roles: STUDENT

{ "type": "USERS" }

### 409 - already running (run it immediately after 202 SUCCESS)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/data-importer/import
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Roles: ADMIN

{ "type": "USERS" }

